{"kp_id": "zj-055.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-055", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "太冲治妇人恶露不止、血崩及男子疝痛阴痛；效差可同经上下加行间。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lr3", "acupoint.lr2"], "chapter_id": "zj-055.c01", "evidence_quote": "恶露不止血崩", "seg_from": 5, "seg_to": 7, "start_s": 21.15, "end_s": 43.27, "citation": {"youtube_id": "0x3HxE1jkzE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0x3HxE1jkzE&t=21s", "series": "zj", "episode": 55, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia: \"Humanity\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90-Episode Series) - Acupuncture 55", "start_s": 21.15, "end_s": 43.27}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-055.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-055", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "太冲与合谷可左右对侧对称刺，不拘补泻虚实寒热。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lr3", "acupoint.li4"], "chapter_id": "zj-055.c01", "evidence_quote": "无所谓补泻啊", "seg_from": 25, "seg_to": 25, "start_s": 137.15, "end_s": 154.51, "citation": {"youtube_id": "0x3HxE1jkzE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0x3HxE1jkzE&t=137s", "series": "zj", "episode": 55, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia: \"Humanity\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90-Episode Series) - Acupuncture 55", "start_s": 137.15, "end_s": 154.51}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "颌骨=合谷", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-055.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-055", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "蠡沟为肝经络穴，内踝上五寸，虚实皆可；肝实证挺纵、虚证皮肤痒等可取络穴或郄穴。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lr5", "concept.luo_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-055.c02", "evidence_quote": "李沟穴是肝经的这个落穴", "seg_from": 62, "seg_to": 69, "start_s": 350.9, "end_s": 417.52, "citation": {"youtube_id": "0x3HxE1jkzE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0x3HxE1jkzE&t=350s", "series": "zj", "episode": 55, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia: \"Humanity\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90-Episode Series) - Acupuncture 55", "start_s": 350.9, "end_s": 417.52}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "李沟=蠡沟；落穴=络穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-055.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-055", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "中都在中封上两寸（内踝上七寸），妇人产后恶露常用。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lr6"], "chapter_id": "zj-055.c02", "evidence_quote": "就是中都内鲁上七寸", "seg_from": 79, "seg_to": 82, "start_s": 491.61, "end_s": 512.225, "citation": {"youtube_id": "0x3HxE1jkzE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0x3HxE1jkzE&t=491s", "series": "zj", "episode": 55, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia: \"Humanity\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90-Episode Series) - Acupuncture 55", "start_s": 491.61, "end_s": 512.23}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "内鲁=内踝", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-055.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-055", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "膝关在膝内侧上约五分，膝痛重时常加针加重。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lr7"], "chapter_id": "zj-055.c03", "evidence_quote": "这个穴道就是膝关", "seg_from": 90, "seg_to": 96, "start_s": 546.68, "end_s": 568.565, "citation": {"youtube_id": "0x3HxE1jkzE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0x3HxE1jkzE&t=546s", "series": "zj", "episode": 55, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia: \"Humanity\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90-Episode Series) - Acupuncture 55", "start_s": 546.68, "end_s": 568.57}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-055.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-055", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "阴包约在曲泉上三寸（或膝关上四寸），主小便不利。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lr9"], "chapter_id": "zj-055.c03", "evidence_quote": "就是的阴猫", "seg_from": 125, "seg_to": 127, "start_s": 720.22, "end_s": 742.815, "citation": {"youtube_id": "0x3HxE1jkzE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0x3HxE1jkzE&t=720s", "series": "zj", "episode": 55, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia: \"Humanity\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90-Episode Series) - Acupuncture 55", "start_s": 720.22, "end_s": 742.82}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "阴猫=阴包", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-055.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-055", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "近腹腔穴多隔姜灸，因动脉密布，慎深刺。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.lr"], "chapter_id": "zj-055.c03", "evidence_quote": "隔了生姜去救好", "seg_from": 214, "seg_to": 215, "start_s": 1210.53, "end_s": 1222.985, "citation": {"youtube_id": "0x3HxE1jkzE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0x3HxE1jkzE&t=1210s", "series": "zj", "episode": 55, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia: \"Humanity\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90-Episode Series) - Acupuncture 55", "start_s": 1210.53, "end_s": 1222.98}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "救=灸", "source": "llm_read"}
